#ASSERT `s32(2) the subordinate instrument may apply, adopt or incorporate the matter` TRUE (Date 1 7 1992) (Date 1 7 1991) FALSE VicAStatutoryRuleMadeUnderACommonwealthActApplied VicAsInForceFromTimeToTime EQUALS JUST TRUE
