#ASSERT `s32(2) the subordinate instrument may apply, adopt or incorporate the matter` FALSE (Date 1 7 1992) (Date 1 7 1991) FALSE VicAnActApplied VicAsInForceAtAParticularTime EQUALS JUST FALSE
